    description: "Identified across 3 DEEP bakeoffs (57 repos). Go: .String()→gin.Context.String, .Run()→gin.Engine.Run. Rust: .put()→reqwest, .read_to_end()→TcpStream. Python: .write()→asyncio.StreamWriter. Java: .put()→RestTemplate.put. Sessions: deep-20260330-035757, -043124, -044609."  # a67b
    fields:  # a67b
      statement: "IO boundary classification must verify the receiver type (or at minimum the containing module/import), not just the method name, because common method names (.String, .Run, .read, .put, .write) appear on unrelated types and produce false positives"  # a67b
      root_cause: "match_edge_to_primitive in io_boundary.py matches callee name against IO primitive catalog without checking the receiver type or import context"  # a67b
